# Agent Workstation

This is a Clawdult-managed AI agent workstation.

## Environment

- **OS**: Ubuntu {{ ansible_distribution_release }}
- **Node.js**: v{{ node_version }}
- **Python**: {{ python_version }}
- **Go**: {{ go_version }}
- **Rust**: Latest stable (via rustup)
- **Docker**: Installed with compose plugin

## Directory Structure

- `/opt/clawdult/workspace/projects/` - Project working directory
- `/opt/clawdult/config/` - Agent configuration
- `/opt/clawdult/logs/` - Agent, audit, and CLI logs
- `/opt/clawdult/secrets/` - In-memory secrets (tmpfs)
- `/opt/clawdult/tools/` - Tool configurations

## Available Tools

- **Claude Code** (`claude`) - AI coding assistant CLI
- **Codex CLI** (`codex`) - OpenAI coding assistant CLI
- **GitHub CLI** (`gh`) - GitHub operations
- **AWS CLI** (`aws`) - AWS operations (scoped to agent permissions)
- **Docker** (`docker`) - Container management
- **Playwright MCP** - Browser automation (port 8931)

## Security

- All commands are logged via auditd
- Network can be blocked via kill switch (`/opt/clawdult/bin/kill-switch`)
- Secrets are stored in tmpfs (never touch disk)
- IAM permissions are scoped to this agent's resources only
